{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"3417140","name":"IGS经典街机合集","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IGS经典街机游戏移植作品！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >将《三国战纪》等 8款 IGS人气街机游戏集于一件作品中。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >最高支持4人线上对战！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >集合了8款IGS经典人气街机游戏的合集闪亮登场，让玩家重拾童年回忆！合集中收录了多个系列的《三国战纪》游戏，并且全部支持线上多人对战。同时还包含了诸如《西游释厄传》、《形意拳》在内的人气热门街机游戏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>原汁原味的街机体验</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完整保留了原本的游戏内容，将此前街机上体验到的剧情再度重现！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >街机风格的显示画面，把当时的氛围完美烘托！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>充实的本地或在线对战</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家可以选择最高4人本地或在线对战，与你的朋友一起合力闯关，战胜BOSS！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>新手也能快速上手</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本合集中的游戏均包含了难度选项，即使是新手也可以快速上手游玩！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏高手也可以挑战最高难度，一次次突破自己的极限！同时也可以使用随地存档/载入的功能，让玩家随处重新挑战！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >此外，游戏内搭载了各角色的出招表与一键出招功能，还提供自定义按键配置功能，让玩家无须复杂操作，也能轻松享受爽快的游戏体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>多种风格的游戏画面</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >提供多种画面显示模式，从充满怀旧风格的画面到清晰细腻的高清画面，玩家可依照个人喜好自由切换，享受最适合自己的视觉体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※ 可在主菜单自由选择语言，并以所选语言版本进行游戏（简体中文、繁体中文、英文、日文及韩文）。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>收录作品</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《三国战纪 风云再起》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《三国战纪 正宗PLUS》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417140/extras/c357301c6db0f0c29cf422ef953f2ee9.poster.avif?t=1786609562\" width=690 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417140/extras/c357301c6db0f0c29cf422ef953f2ee9.webm?t=1786609562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417140/extras/c357301c6db0f0c29cf422ef953f2ee9.mp4?t=1786609562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《三国战纪2 群雄争霸》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417140/extras/25c3f5293fd8aa38e2c729449152c824.poster.avif?t=1786609562\" width=690 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417140/extras/25c3f5293fd8aa38e2c729449152c824.webm?t=1786609562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417140/extras/25c3f5293fd8aa38e2c729449152c824.mp4?t=1786609562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《西游释厄传》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《西游释厄传 群魔乱舞》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417140/extras/8108816c851ca7b77d34bee4314a86c5.poster.avif?t=1786609562\" width=690 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417140/extras/8108816c851ca7b77d34bee4314a86c5.webm?t=1786609562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417140/extras/8108816c851ca7b77d34bee4314a86c5.mp4?t=1786609562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>※《西游释厄传》/《西游释厄传 群魔乱舞》不支援日文字幕。</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>※《西游释厄传》不支援韩文字幕。</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《形意拳》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi