/bc3fb8fd0b018d2bcd149d28b90ff1c7.mp4?t=1786609562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>※《神剑风云》日文版不支持背景音乐。</i></p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417140/4e07fc8e83dfa939f63ca1debafb76140784349f/header_schinese.jpg?t=1786609562","website":"","developers":["IGS(台灣鈊象電子)"],"publishers":["H2 Interactive Co., Ltd."],"release_date":"2026 年 8 月 12 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"29.99","final":"26.99","discount":10},"supported_languages":"英语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 日语, 韩语","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","多人","玩家对战","线上玩家对战","同屏/分屏玩家对战","合作","在线合作","同屏/分屏合作","同屏/分屏","Steam 集换式卡牌","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","部分支持控制器","远程同乐","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","冒险"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows® 10 (64-bit required)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel® Core™ 2 Duo 2.4 GHz, or better<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 460, or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>网络:</strong> 宽带互联网连接<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 2 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> DirectSound compatible (must support DirectX 9.0c or higher)<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> 建议使用 1920×1080 分辨率进行游戏，在更高分辨率环境下，画面可能会出现显示异常。</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows® 10 (64-bit required)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel® Core™ 2 Quad 2.7 GHz, or better<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 560, or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>网络:</strong> 宽带互联网连接<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 2 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> DirectSound compatible (must suppo